"node_id":"LA_kwDOAAe_f88AAAABW07bDQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/labels/:Analytics/ES%7CQL","name":":Analytics/ES|QL","color":"20840E","default":false,"description":"AKA ESQL"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-12-22T12:44:16Z","updated_at":"2026-01-22T10:42:19Z","closed_at":"2026-01-22T10:42:19Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Description\n\nThere's a difference between how `STATS` behaves compared to `INLINE STATS` caused by `null` grouping/joining that we should look into:\n```\nROW x = 1\n| STATS c = COUNT(*) BY n = null\n| KEEP c, n\n| LIMIT 1\n```\nyields:\n```\n       c       |       n       \n---------------+---------------\n1              |null           \n```\n\nHowever,\n```\nROW x = 1\n| INLINE STATS c = COUNT(*) BY n = null\n| KEEP c, n\n| LIMIT 1\n```\nyields:\n```\n       c       |       n       \n---------------+---------------\nnull           |null           \n```","closed_by":{"login":"elasticsearchmachine","id":58790826,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NzkwODI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58790826?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/elasticsearchmachine","html_url":"https://github.com/elasticsearchmachine","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elasticsearchmachine/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elasticsearchmachine/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elasticsearchmachine/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elasticsearchmachine/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elasticsearchmachine/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elasticsearc